<% layout('/layouts/boilerplate') -%>

<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-12 col-lg-8 mx-auto">
      <div class="card border-0 shadow-md p-4 p-md-5" style="border-radius: var(--radius-xl); background: var(--bg-surface);">
        <div class="border-bottom pb-4 mb-4">
          <div class="d-inline-flex align-items-center justify-content-center bg-danger bg-opacity-10 text-danger rounded-circle p-3 mb-3">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-file-contract fs-3"></i>
          </div>
          <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2">Terms & Conditions</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Last updated: August 2026</p>
        </div>

        <p class="lead text-body mb-4">
          Welcome to Wanderlust. By accessing or using our website, services, and platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms & Conditions.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">1. Account Registration</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          You must provide accurate, complete, and current information when registering for an account. You are solely responsible for keeping your login credentials secure.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">2. Listing & Hosting Rules</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          Users listing properties must provide accurate details regarding pricing, location, amenities, and high-quality photos. Misleading listings or fraudulent host claims are strictly prohibited.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">3. Reviews & Community Guidelines</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          Reviews posted on Wanderlust must reflect genuine guest experiences. Spam, hate speech, or extortionary reviews will be deleted immediately.
        </p>

        <h4 class="fw-bold text-dark mt-4">4. Termination</h4>
        <p class="text-secondary">
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate our terms, safety policies, or community standards.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-5 pt-3 border-top">
          <a href="/listings" class="btn btn-auth-secondary rounded-pill px-4">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left me-2"></i> Back to Stays
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
